ita ke pati ka kaam kar rahe hai.\"»\n\nThe remark has gone viral, drawing mixed reactions across social media. While some users praised it as political satire, others criticized it as offensive or partisan.\n\n💬 Public Reaction:\n\n• \"Supporters called it sharp political satire.\" 🎭\n\n• \"Critics said the remark crossed the line.\" ⚖️\n\n• \"The clip is being widely shared and debated online.\" 📱\n\n✔️ Reality Check:\n\n• This is a satirical comment made by Kunal Kamra during a performance. 🎙️\n\n• It reflects the comedian's expression and should not be interpreted as a factual claim. ⚠️\n\n💭 Ek Zaroori Baat:\n\nPolitical satire often generates strong opinions. Viewers may interpret such remarks differently based on their perspectives, while respectful debate remains an important part of a democratic society.\n\n#KunalKamra #PoliticalSatire #NewsUpdate #India #ViralVideo\n\nइसके कहने का मतलब हैँ राम जी का name ले लेकर अम्बानी अडानी का काम कर rha hai\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nIsss bhen ke lode ganje ko batao ki agar kisi din Nita je pti ka dimag ghoom gya naaa to Sita ka pati bhi nhi bcha payega isko\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nSeeta ji kaun h is ganje ki aukat h unka nam apni third class jawan s le rha h ... Ye ganja ek bar dusre dharm k liye bol de phir dekho tamasha ... Zamin k andar dikhega\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\n😂😂😂\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\nLog in to like or comment.","author":null,"published_date":"2026-07-17T22:22:38.000Z","latency_ms":8046.191015999739,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}